# dbt models). Ignoring the extension silently dropped 15 query files from a commit with no
# error, shipping a non-functional skill to a PR. Ignore DB dumps by name in the repo that
# needs it (e.g. dump.sql, *.dump.sql) rather than blanket-ignoring the extension.
